{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux搜索私钥或口令文件。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Private Key Searching Activity。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux搜索私钥或口令文件","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux搜索私钥或口令文件\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清主机、网络或权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":73,"rule_id":"627374ab-7080-4e4d-8316-bef1122444af","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\nevent.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"process_started\", \"executed\") and\nprocess.name == \"find\" and\nprocess.command_line like (\"*id_dsa*\", \"*id_rsa*\", \"*id_ed*\", \"*id_ecdsa*\", \"*id_xmss*\", \"*id_dh*\") and\nprocess.command_line like (\"*/home/*\", \"*/etc/ssh*\", \"*/root/*\", \"/\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1083","name":"File and Directory Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1083/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1552","name":"Unsecured Credentials","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1552.001","name":"Credentials In Files","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/001/"},{"id":"T1552.004","name":"Private Keys","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":108,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
